msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"%s, huh? That's a good name. From now on, you'll use that while working at "
"the club."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Then I look forward to being your number one girl!\r\n"
"Where do I start!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"First, let's get you changed into an outfit worthy of\r\n"
"your grace and charm. See, as soon as you walk out that\r\n"
"door, you'll be reborn as a head-turning queen of the night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Welcome to our club. We specialize in helping our hostesses\r\n"
"reach the top of the industry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"But first, we need to decide on a stage name for you.\r\n"
"Something that would fit the persona you want to project."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"I'm not quite sure how to pronounce that... Why don't we\r\n"
"come up with something a bit more natural?"
msgstr ""
"Non sono proprio sicuro di come si pronunci... Che ne dici se troviamo "
"qualcosa di un po' più naturale?"

